{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add <strong>SYNCHRONIZERS: UNDEAD MARINES</strong> to your wishlist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This <strong>completely unique gaming experience</strong>, inspired by classics like <strong>StarCraft</strong> and <strong>Plants Vs. Zombies</strong>, takes these concepts to a <strong>whole new level</strong> in a <strong>vibrant sci-fi adventure</strong> featuring <strong>RTS-lite mechanics</strong>, an innovative <strong>Reverse Tower Defense system</strong>, and <strong>2.5D action</strong>, accompanied by a <strong>deep narrative with multiple endings</strong> where your <strong>moral choices</strong> will bring you closer or further from the <strong>true ending</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your journey you will be able to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your squad:</strong> choose your favorite units and combine their attack types and special abilities. Make sure to <strong>protect them</strong> as they advance across the battlefield.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capture and study enemies:</strong> weaken corrupted enemy units and capture enough of each type to use them to your advantage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade technologies and strengthen your Arcturus ship</strong> and teleportation bases, exploring its systems and rooms that serve not only for combat but also as the <strong>home and refuge of the protagonists</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tend your Pranic Garden</strong>, a space garden where you cultivate alien flora and fauna that provide <strong>energy and tranquility</strong> amid the <strong>chaos</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore over 25 levels</strong> with dynamic weather, new worlds, and increasingly challenging enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immerse yourself in the story of a defective clone</strong> who rebels against an oppressive regime and uncovers an <strong>ancient extraterrestrial secret</strong> that will change his destiny.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy an exciting original soundtrack</strong> that enhances every moment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Break the strategy with On-Rails First Person Shooter sections</strong>, adding <strong>intensity and variety</strong> in certain space levels.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just a tower defense or strategy game; it\u2019s an <strong>emotional and epic journey</strong> where <strong>strategy, action, and narrative</strong> come together in an <strong>unforgettable experience</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656280/extras/e2dd17d628dac2fafc68344843255929.poster.avif?t=1770127331\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656280/extras/e2dd17d628dac2fafc68344843255929.webm?t=1770127331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656280/extras/e2dd17d628dac2fafc68344843255929.mp4?t=1770127331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1656280?t=1770127331","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656280/24522f9beee0c1e024e3baa9a2535099ef80ee2b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770127331","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656280/b07a355099a2aff493e81347b98402630bfad086/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770127331","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656280/b07a355099a2aff493e81347b98402630bfad086/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770127331","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}